cff-version: 1.2.0
title: redassay
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "RedAssay"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RedAssay/security-audit-skill"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic security audit loop for Claude Code. A standard-library-only
  engine scans a codebase, a durable findings repository survives re-scans and
  code motion, and a local review board keeps a human between every finding and
  the fix that gets applied.
keywords:
  - security
  - static-analysis
  - sast
  - taint-analysis
  - claude-code
  - vulnerability-scanner
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-14"
